    description: "Entry kind go_handler is language-named, has a live producer, and has no fold target.\n\nThe entry-point-kinds audit (docs/audits/0027) left go_handler unruled: it is named for a language (ADR-0027: a kind names what a thing is, not its language or framework), it has a live producer (a Go ServeHTTP method), and taint.py (~4630, ~4651) reads the value. The other framework-named kinds FOLD into http_route / controller, but a ServeHTTP method has no route path, so http_route does not fit as it stands. Options: a language-neutral request-handler kind (go_handler becomes one producer of it), or fold into http_route with an absent path. Needs an owner decision. Repro: survey caddy and list entries of kind go_handler; grep go_handler packages/hypergumbo-core/src/hypergumbo_core/taint.py."  # 367c
    fields: {}  # 367c
